  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society IDF I - HR civ soc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civila samh&#xE4;llet IDF I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Oberoende utvecklingsfonden &#xE4;r en givargemensam mekanisn skapad f&#xF6;r att ge st&#xF6;d och service till ugandiska organisationer i civilsamh&#xE4;llet. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka deras kapacitet att effektivt bidra till f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttssituation, demokratisk samh&#xE4;llsstyrning och fattigdomsminskning. St&#xF6;d och service ges i form av bidrag till organisationerna. Sidas st&#xF6;d &#xE4;r 2,5 MSEK 2009-10.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Independent Development Fund is a joint donor funding mechanism created to offer support services to Ugandan civil society organizations to strengthen their capacities to effectively  contribute to the country&apos;s human rights, good governance and poverty reduction efforts. These support services are provided through grants and grant management support. Sida support is 2,5 MSEK 2009-10.</narrative>
  </description>
